# Claude config: ship the shared base (`settings.json` — repo-wide hooks
# + permissions) but keep per-developer overrides + caches ignored.
# Project-local skills (`.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`) ship with the repo
# so the truth-verification protocol and any future skills are discoverable
# by every clone.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

